                    <p>My experience across technical operations and software development has shaped how I approach engineering. I value understanding the broader system, identifying root causes, making thoughtful architectural decisions, and building solutions that can evolve over time.</p>
                    <p>I also embrace modern development tools, including AI coding assistants, to improve productivity while maintaining ownership of architecture, implementation decisions, and code quality.</p>
